 and performance enhancements\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        April 4, 2026 · GitHub Release\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">88 GitHub reactions on release (38 👍, 10 🎉, 14 ❤️, 10 🚀)</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">Source: GitHub Releases · Sentiment: Positive</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.91\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code v2.1.91</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        MCP tool persistence and plugin enhancements with multi-line prompt support in deep links\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        April 2, 2026 · GitHub Release\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.119.0-alpha.9\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI v0.119.0-alpha.9</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Rust SDK pre-release with multi-platform binary support and argument comment lint tool\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        April 4, 2026 · Pre-release\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">4 GitHub reactions on release (4 🚀)</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">Source: GitHub Releases · Sentiment: Positive</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.37.0-preview.1\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.37.0-preview.1</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Patch release for preview version, cherry-picking fix to address issues in previous build\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        April 2, 2026 · Patch Release\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback\">\n                        <div class=\"feedback-quote\">60 downloads of gemini-cli-bundle.zip</div>\n                        <div class=\"feedback-source\">Source: GitHub Releases · Sentiment: Neutral</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.3.38-vscode\" target=\"_blank\">Continue v1.3.38</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        VS Code extension release with builds for multiple platforms and architectures\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        March 27, 2026 · VS Code Extension\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Products with No Updates Column (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">Products Without Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-inactive\">❌</span> Cursor\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        No public GitHub repository found for releases. Proprietary/closed-source distribution model.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Closed Source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-inactive\">❌</span> GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        No public GitHub repository for releases. Integrated directly into VS Code/IDEs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Closed Source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-inactive\">❌</span> Windsurf\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        No public GitHub repository found for recent releases. Part of Codeium ecosystem.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Closed Source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-inactive\">❌</span> Devin\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        No public GitHub repository found for releases. Closed-source AI agent platform.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Closed Source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-inactive\">❌</span> Aider\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Latest releases (v0.86.0, v0.85.0, v0.84.0) are from 2025. No updates in current window.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Open Source</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Inactive</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Key Highlights & Methodology Column (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"highlights\">\n                <h2 class=\"column-header\">Key Highlights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-active\">✓</span> Most Active Product\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Claude Code</strong> had two major releases in quick succession (v2.1.91 and v2.1.92)\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-active\">✓</span> Significant Feature\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Bedrock integration</strong> with interactive setup wizard for AWS authentication\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-active\">✓</span> Performance Boost\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>60% faster</strong> diff computation in Claude Code's Write tool\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"status-active\">✓</span> Ecosystem Growth\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</strong> enhancements show growing ecosystem support\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4; padding-top: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;\" id=\"methodology\">Methodology</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"highlights-list\">\n                        <li>Searched official GitHub repositories for releases</li>\n                        <li>Checked releases between March 22 - April 5, 2026</li>\n                        <li>Collected community feedback from GitHub reactions</li>\n                        <li>Focused on verified, official sources only</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4; padding-top: 10px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Limitations</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"highlights-list\">\n                        <li>Web search tools were rate-limited during research</li>\n                        <li>Community feedback limited to GitHub reactions only</li>\n                        <li>Closed-source products couldn't be tracked via GitHub</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                Generated on 2026-04-05 ·\n                <a href=\"#\">About</a> ·\n                <a href=\"#\">Archive</a> ·\n                <a href=\"#\">RSS Feed</a>\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                Tracking AI coding agents, IDEs, and developer tools · Data from GitHub releases\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
